### Info 
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/info


### Register the app (run once)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "data_validation_app",
    "email": "data.validation@alramz.ae",
    "password": "password123",
    "roles": ["APP_DATA_VALIDATION"],
    "application": "data-validation-service",
    "environment": "local"
}

###

### Login to get JWT token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "data_validation_app",
    "password": "password123"
}

###

### Validate IBAN
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/iban/validate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
    "IBAN": "AE460260001015862843301"
}

### Validate IBAN -ve test case
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/iban/validate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
    "IBAN": ""
}

